        "id": 241018,
        "name": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "username": "starkenburg_alexander",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/starkenburg_alexander/{size}/1857_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-10-25T00:08:22.011Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hit randomize, got Wager Master vs AA, Chrono- Ranger, and Redeemer Fanatic at the Enclave.</p>\n<p>WM plays 2 wagelings and a Playing Dice with the Cosmos. Figured I’d be able to bring one Wageling down so they are farther away from their lose condition, but Fanatic didn’t start with any damage cards and CR could only do 2. AA started with no songs to play so did nothing.</p>\n<p>Environment plays Slamara, who then plays another wageling. The heroes got Syncopated onslaught, Displaced Armory (so wageling to 3), and Absolution.</p>\n<p>Then I lost <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/confused.png?v=10\" title=\":confused:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":confused:\"></p>\n<p>I think that’s the fastest loss I’ve had on WM. I guess it makes up for the win I had before the heroes even had a turn.</p>\n<p>~A-Kat</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-10-25T00:08:22.011Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
